  msteps RSEGS (L5SAR.st fx5 R5 pc5 (mrestrict (ahid Awy modely) My)) (L5SAR.st fx6 R6 pc6 M6v) -> mem_grows (mrestrict (ahid Awy modely) My) M6v ->
  (forall i : Z, 0 <= i < 2 ^ 64 -> M6v (Z_to_bv 64 i) = mrestrict (ahid Awy modely) My (Z_to_bv 64 i)) ->
  (forall model7, GM BX1 My model7 LKy Awy cry -> srealizes RSEGS SCFG (@PMSP.cfg RSEGS fx6 R6 pc6 My model7) K) ->
  srealizes RSEGS SCFG (@PMSP.cfg RSEGS fx5 R5 pc5 My modely) K.
Proof.
